  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skogsstyrelsen - The Forest Dialogue (TFD)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Forest Agency -                       The Forest Dialogue (TFD) - Skogsstyrelsen TFD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The Forest Dialogue (Skogsdialogen) &#xe4;r en plattform och process f&#xf6;r   multi-intressent-samr&#xe5;d och samarbete betr&#xe4;ffande de mest br&#xe5;dskande  lokala och globala fr&#xe5;gor som r&#xf6;r skog-m&#xe4;nniskor. Sida st&#xf6;dde den     tematiska dialogen om &quot;Att investera i lokalt kontrollerat skogsbruk&quot; under 2012. Ett av samr&#xe5;dsm&#xf6;tena h&#xf6;lls i Sverige i juni 2012.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The forest dialogue (TFD) is a platform and process for               multi-stakeholder discussion and collaboration on the most pressing   local and global issues facing forests and people. Sida supported the thematic dialogue on &quot;Investing in locally controlled forestry&quot;       during 2012, one of the meetings held in Sweden in June 2012.</narrative>
  </description>
